{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical competitive shooter. WTF strips multiplayer FPS gameplay down to its core: Pitched battles and frenetic combat on small maps specifically designed for mobility and verticality. The conflict evolves and escalates with every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/1fd8bc006ecf925d21408cb996e3d122.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/1fd8bc006ecf925d21408cb996e3d122.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/1fd8bc006ecf925d21408cb996e3d122.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches to earn resources to build your Mother Base, which unlocks more guns, perks, abilities, and skins for you to take back into battle. Tune and theorycraft the perfect loadout with deep equipment and perk customization. Every round presents fresh upgrade decisions that shape your path to victory. Select new perks each round to create your ultimate build.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/f17a987bf8d40168c9e2c7b1071ad52f.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/cadb16fde8e40d1472de2f52e24f9039.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/cadb16fde8e40d1472de2f52e24f9039.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/cadb16fde8e40d1472de2f52e24f9039.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA net code with regional dedicated servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive live service bloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/bf0a3d32b7da2eb3904c960eb6bab261.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your match earnings and fund your mercenary company. Unlock &amp; recruit new operators to assist you in battle and build your Mother Base.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn base and company upgrades in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Mother Base to unlock new perks, weapons, and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with, or invade, other players\u2019 Mother Bases to achieve world domination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2353050?t=1770292470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/334f0fb6b9626886d6bf65797e384bfd6b1f5872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770292470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/01c8c5c614ab9c79509e56688e1c8d28c4c964b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770292470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/01c8c5c614ab9c79509e56688e1c8d28c4c964b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770292470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Exclusive Playtests and More!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/c8b6b6e078b32b6bd2aae752160f00bb.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/5e2ce26bc3227fd1bbd10578048be6d6.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical competitive shooter. WTF strips multiplayer FPS gameplay down to its core: Pitched battles and frenetic combat on small maps specifically designed for mobility and verticality. The conflict evolves and escalates with every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha