pps/2353050/extras/cadb16fde8e40d1472de2f52e24f9039.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA net code with regional dedicated servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive live service bloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/bf0a3d32b7da2eb3904c960eb6bab261.avif?t=1770292470\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.poster.avif?t=1770292470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.webm?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96d31d37a7b62ecbcd1e526f4e1b4e1c.mp4?t=1770292470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your match earnings and fund your mercenary company. Unlock &amp; recruit new operators to assist you in battle and build your Mother Base.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn base and company upgrades in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Mother Base to unlock new perks, weapons, and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with, or invade, other players\u2019 Mother Bases to achieve world domination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Team Waifu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":